---
title: Definition 21
---
order: 21
---
short_label: XI.Def.21
---
statement: When a rectangular parallelogram with one side of those about the right angle remains fixed is carried round and restored again to the same position from which it began to be moved, the figure so comprehended is a <i>cylinder</i>.
